<Mod id="1dfaa807-83b1-4bca-b133-3f3a5ce6d21b" version="2">
  <Properties>
    <Name>Songkran Wonder Pack</Name>
    <Teaser>Across April 13-15 is a celebration of Songkran in South East Asian countries, especially Thailand. Songkran is traditionally t</Teaser>
    <Description>Across April 13-15, Songkran is celebrated in South East Asian countries, particularily Thailand. Historically it marked the beginning of the Thai New Year, however in recent times this has changed to be January 1 in line with the rest of the world. Songkran remains a national holiday, and is celebrated in part by water throwing. To celebrate Songkran, we have released a wonder pack comprising of four Thai wonders - Amphawa Floating Market, the Democracy Monument, Khao San Road and Wat Pho. These are all modular, and can be enabled / disabled at any time.</Description>
    <Authors>Pouakai, sukritact</Authors>
    <SpecialThanks>Huehueteotl</SpecialThanks>
    <HideSetupGame>0</HideSetupGame>
